WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.435
De Giorgi's conjecture, dimension eight.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.514
A solution rising in one direction should be

3
00:00:05.514 --> 00:00:07.714
a flat wall. Humans reached dimension four.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.938
Limits are stable one dimension down, where every stable solution is flat.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.448
Claimed: dimension eight, the last case.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.950
No Lean proof.
